          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are so suspicious of everyone you meet that you keep mental notes on how to defeat them all-even your own allies.</p>\n<p>After interacting with a creature for at least 1 minute, you automatically @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Pursue a Lead] with that creature as the subject. You can have any number of such leads at any given time, and when you Pursue a Lead again, you don't give up any of these automatic subjects.</p>"
          },
